## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### **Common Issues**

### **Technical Limitations**
1. **Filter bugs (temporary)**
   - game_start_time filter treating valid times as "missing"
   - Lineup check marking all players as "scratched"
   - Fixes in development, ETA 30-60 minutes

2. **Historical coverage_overall gap**
   - May 5-11 legs (1,820 samples) have NULL coverage_overall
   - Will remain NULL permanently (no backfill planned)
   - New data accumulates at ~150-200 legs/day

3. **Pitcher data not wired** (Phase 3 work)
   - pitcher_id, pitcher_era, etc. columns exist but are NULL
   - Phase 3 will populate and use in scoring logic
   - ETA: 3-4 hours after filter fixes complete

[Keep remaining limitations from May 11 version]

**Issue:** Scoring adjustments not appearing in logs
- **Cause:** Wrong commit deployed
- **Solution:** Check `git log --oneline -3`, verify commit e481f22 or later

**Issue:** Regenerate button returns cached parlays
- **Cause:** game_start_time still NULL, or deployment not complete
- **Solution:** Wait 2 minutes after deployment, click again, check Railway logs

**Issue:** All legs filtered out (0 eligible)
- **Cause:** game_start_time all NULL
- **Solution:** Check database, verify regenerate fallback working

**Issue:** Dashboard HTTP 500 errors
- **Cause:** Should not occur after May 8 fixes
- **Solution:** Check Railway logs, verify v1/v2 integration code

